; With use_precise_interpolation, an interpolated number is rounded to the
; finest precision the transaction's numbers state, not the coarsest: five
; digits here, where the default rounds to one and books -7.0 USD.
option "use_precise_interpolation" "TRUE"

2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "Interpolated to five digits"
  Assets:A  10.12345 USD
  Assets:B  -3.1 USD
  Assets:C

2020-01-03 balance Assets:C  -7.02345 USD
